1
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:03,359
(Penny:)I'm the one that introduced him to her.
I've gotta say something.

2
00:00:06,909 --> 00:00:08,409
(Penny:)Wow.

3
00:00:09,995 --> 00:00:12,995
(Penny:)- You're engaged to my friend.
- Hey, Bernadette doesn't mind...

4
00:00:13,165 --> 00:00:17,125
(Howard:)...where I get my motor running,
as long as I park in the right garage.

5
00:00:19,338 --> 00:00:21,968
(Penny:)I can't believe you're engaged
to my friend.

6
00:00:24,343 --> 00:00:25,763
(Penny:)Oh, here she comes.

7
00:00:25,928 --> 00:00:29,138
(Howard:)Smart. Whisper,
so the deaf chick can't hear you.

8
00:00:33,102 --> 00:00:36,442
(Sheldon:)- Hi.
- Oh, hey. Hi. Nice to see you.

9
00:00:36,605 --> 00:00:39,855
(Penny:)Um, can we talk to you about Raj?

10
00:00:40,651 --> 00:00:42,441
She says, "Sure, what about him?"

11
00:00:42,611 --> 00:00:44,991
(Penny:)Okay. Um, gosh, how do I start?

12
00:00:45,155 --> 00:00:49,035
(Penny:)Um, see, Raj is kind of naive.

13
00:00:49,201 --> 00:00:51,161
(Penny:)He hasn't dated
a whole lot of women.

14
00:00:51,328 --> 00:00:54,578
(Penny:)And I'm concerned that,
without meaning to...

15
00:00:54,748 --> 00:00:56,878
(Penny:)...you might be taking advantage
of him.

16
00:00:57,042 --> 00:00:59,502
(Penny:)By letting him buy you
a bunch of expensive things.

